; The persistent factory retains its existing exact unit label. The two
; per-generation early actors receive one additional fixed unit-file label.
; RefUnit is deliberately unused: systemd authorizes it with service start.
; The helper gains only status/stop, with no direct unit-file body access.
(type droidloom_package_early_unit_file)
(roletype object_r droidloom_package_early_unit_file)
(typeattributeset p4_linux_data (droidloom_package_early_unit_file))
